---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---
<InfoLayout
  path="/contact"
  title="Contact RateKit"
  description="Get in touch with the RateKit team. Suggest a new calculator, report a bug, or ask a question."
  pageTag="Get in touch"
  h1="Contact Us"
  pageSub="We read every message. Typically reply within 48 hours."
  breadcrumbLabel="Contact"
>
  <div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Best way to reach us:</strong> Email <a href="mailto:connect4fund@gmail.com">connect4fund@gmail.com</a>
  </div>

  <p>RateKit is built and maintained by <strong>Azat Israilov</strong> (<a href="https://azatisrail.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">azatisrail.org</a>). I'm open to suggestions about the site — new calculators, fixes, anything you'd change.</p>

  <h2>What We Can Help With</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>🐛 <strong>Bug reports</strong> — found a calculation that seems wrong?</li>
    <li>💡 <strong>New calculator ideas</strong> — what tool would help your business?</li>
    <li>🤝 <strong>Partnerships</strong> — interested in collaborating or featuring RateKit?</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Response Time</h2>
  <p>We aim to respond to all emails within 48 hours on business days. For bug reports with screenshots, we usually respond faster.</p>

  <h2>Feature Requests</h2>
  <p>We love hearing what calculators would be useful. The most-requested tools get built first. Tell us what you need at <a href="mailto:connect4fund@gmail.com">connect4fund@gmail.com</a> with the subject line "Calculator idea".</p>

  <h2>Support RateKit</h2>
  <p>RateKit is free and always will be for core features. If it saved you time and you'd like to support the work, you can do so here — entirely optional, no perks attached:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>☕ <a href="https://ko-fi.com/ontoguzlabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ko-fi — ko-fi.com/ontoguzlabs</a></li>
    <li>🎗️ <a href="https://patreon.com/AzatIsrailov" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Patreon — patreon.com/AzatIsrailov</a></li>
  </ul>
</InfoLayout>
